# THIRTY MINUTES ON THE HOME COAST (docs/ROADMAP.md, slice 1): the slice's proof,
# played from the title the way a player starts, with nothing given, no folk and
# no beats pre-landed. Each step of the slice extends it.
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/home-coast.tour --scene=title --seed=1
#
# 1a THE WAKE (48_wake): a new game starts him under the water in the shallows
# off the spawn beach, the black site in the sea behind him and Maren at the
# water's edge. 01 he breaks the surface; 02 he stands in the surf with his legs,
# from above; 03 the first sight of the Tether; 04 over the shoulder, looking to
# the shore and her.
await title 40
# New game heads the title's list when there is no save to continue; with one,
# continue would, and `await character` below fails rather than play a save.
tap use
await character 8
key move_up
key use
await game 40
await waking 5
wait 0.4
shot 01-he-breaks-the-surface with waking,wake:staged
await woken 10
wait 1.0
shot 02-in-the-surf-from-above with woken,cast:maren
# 1b THE FIRST SIGHT (48_wake, 42_stage): a breath after he stands, the view
# turns once to the far horizon and up the Tether to the Foundry, and holds.
await staging:tether 6
wait 1.2
shot 03-the-first-sight with staging:tether,tether
wait 4.0
tap shoulder
await shoulder 20
wait 1.0
shot 04-in-the-surf-over-the-shoulder with woken,cast:maren,shoulder

# 2 MAREN'S ASK BECOMES THE GOAL (Guide._led, StoryContent.LEAD): he goes to her
# at the water's edge and talks, taking the first reply each time, as a player
# who just keeps talking does, until she gives his first lead; then the goal
# line is her lead in her words, and it points on to the crew's camp.
at cast:maren
await cast:maren 8
wait 0.6
press use
await talking 3
wait 0.4
shot 05-maren-at-the-water with talking,cast:maren
press use
wait 0.5
press use
wait 0.5
press use
wait 0.5
press use
await beat:marens_lead 3
wait 0.5
shot 06-her-lead with talking,beat:marens_lead
press use
wait 2.5
shot 07-the-goal-is-hers with beat:marens_lead
